    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get into your gunship and defend the planet from flying alien armies in this action-packed shoot 'em up game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense twin-stick shoot 'em up action!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamepad is preferred but also keyboard + mouse is supported</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle in the air against aliens from outer space</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash total destruction with dozens of powerups!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock powerful gunships and mechs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special endless attack modes for the true hardcore shmup fans!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get into your gunship and defend the planet from flying alien armies in this action-packed shoot 'em up game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense twin-stick shoot 'em up action!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamepad is preferred but also keyboard + mouse is supported</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle in the air against aliens from outer space</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash total destruction with dozens of powerups!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock powerful gunships and mechs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special endless attack modes for the true hardcore shmup fans!</p></li></ul>",
